## ✅ 6. Accessible Table (ARIA and Scope)

```html
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col">Country</th>
      <th scope="col">Capital</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row">India</th>
      <td>New Delhi</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row">France</th>
      <td>Paris</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

