## ✅ 7. Interactive Table with Hover & Highlight

```html
<style>
  table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
  }

  th, td {
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
  }

  tr:hover {
    background-color: #ffeeba;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  th {
    background-color: #343a40;
    color: white;
  }
</style>
```

