## ✅ 9. Sticky Table Headers

```html
<style>
  .sticky-table {
    max-height: 200px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .sticky-table table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .sticky-table th {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    background: #222;
    color: white;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .sticky-table th, .sticky-table td {
    padding: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
</style>

<div class="sticky-table">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Name</th><th>Role</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Boss</td><td>Student</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Sarah</td><td>Mentor</td></tr>
      <tr><td>John</td><td>Designer</td></tr>
      <!-- Add more rows -->
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
```

